Source: yousub
Section: web
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Patrick Buhagiar <arobidsh@proton.me>
Homepage: https://github.com/patrickbuhagiar24/youtube
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.4.1
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: yousub
Architecture: all
Recommends: google-chrome-stable
Description: YouTube subscription marker for Chrome
 Registers the signed Yousub Chrome extension built with the repository
 CRX signing key. The extension marks YouTube channels you are not
 subscribed to and can sync unsubscribe history to your own Google Drive.
 .
 No command-line program, native messaging host, or per-user configuration
 files are installed; Drive settings are selected in the extension popup.
